Z||000000||GodSend||09-12-2001||10:41 AM||||The bushings on my dogbone are looking pretyt bad right now , so I am going to do something about it.<P>Is it necessary to replace the entire bogbone and bushings, or just the bushings? (Is there a way to determine if the dogbone itself needs replacing?).<P>I am probably going to go with the bushings that the racetech sells in T.O, any one have these?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Leadfoot||09-12-2001||10:46 AM||||Check out the fierostore website.  They sell the poly bushings and the dog bone.  Depending on what year fiero you have you might need to buy the dog bone.||||reg||1
