Z||000003||Monkeyman||09-12-2001||05:50 PM||||I think the area where the bushings go is tapered on the '87s and '88.  If that's the case, you'll need a new dogbone.  The Fiero Store sells thier Ultimate Dogbone for less than $50US.<P>------------------<BR>'Consciousness:  That annoying time between naps.'<P>MM||||reg||1
