Z||000005||Raydar||09-12-2001||06:53 PM||||Replaced the dog bone in my Formula with the Fiero Store ultimate...<P>The only vibration I noticed was at idle. (Automatic.) <BR>Noticeable, but not really objectionable.<P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<BR><FONT SIZE="1"><BR>Black 88 Formula.<BR>Red 88 Duke coupe. "The Project" <BR>88 Formula parts car. "The Donor"<BR></FONT>||||reg||1
